    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103886" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήτη</span>
			, only in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήτει: σπάνει</span>), unless we read
