				<u>Fr.</u>
				492
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήτει σοφῶν</span>, for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι εἴ τι</span>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῆτος</span>.</div>
